<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>CHROMA-TYPE: GROOVE OVERDRIVE</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Chakra+Petch:wght@400;600;700;800&family=Fira+Code:wght@400;600;700&family=Press+Start+2P&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg-dark: #07060f;
      --bg-surface: rgba(18, 14, 38, 0.85);
      --bg-surface-border: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.3);
      --neon-pink: #ff007f;
      --neon-cyan: #00f3ff;
      --neon-lime: #39ff14;
      --neon-yellow: #ffe600;
      --neon-purple: #bd00ff;
      --neon-orange: #ff7700;
      --finger-pinky: #ff007f;
      --finger-ring: #ff7700;
      --finger-middle: #39ff14;
      --finger-index: #00f3ff;
      --finger-thumb: #bd00ff;
      --font-main: 'Chakra Petch', sans-serif;
      --font-code: 'Fira Code', monospace;
      --font-arcade: 'Press Start 2P', cursive;
    }

    body[data-theme="acid-arcade"] {
      --neon-pink: #00ff88;
      --neon-cyan: #39ff14;
      --neon-lime: #ffff00;
      --neon-yellow: #00f3ff;
      --neon-purple: #00c853;
      --bg-surface-border: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4);
    }
    body[data-theme="hyper-pop"] {
      --neon-pink: #ff0055;
      --neon-cyan: #ff77ee;
      --neon-lime: #00ffff;
      --neon-yellow: #ffdd00;
      --neon-purple: #ff00c8;
      --bg-surface-border: rgba(255, 0, 200, 0.4);
    }
    body[data-theme="cyber-orange"] {
      --neon-pink: #ff5500;
      --neon-cyan: #ffaa00;
      --neon-lime: #ffea00;
      --neon-yellow: #ffffff;
      --neon-purple: #ff2a00;
      --bg-surface-border: rgba(255, 119, 0, 0.4);
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; user-select: none; }
    html, body {
      width: 100%; height: 100%; overflow: hidden;
      background-color: var(--bg-dark); font-family: var(--font-main); color: #ffffff;
    }
    #game-container {
      position: relative; width: 100vw; height: 100vh; overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #140d2e 0%, #080614 70%, #030208 100%);
    }
    #game-canvas { position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; display: block; z-index: 1; }
    .crt-overlay {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none;
      background: linear-gradient(rgba(18, 16, 38, 0) 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35) 50%);
      background-size: 100% 4px; z-index: 10; opacity: 0.6;
    }
    .vignette {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; pointer-events: none;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 100px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9), inset 0 0 40px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.15); z-index: 11;
    }
    .hud-layer { position: absolute; z-index: 20; pointer-events: auto; }
    .hidden { display: none !important; }
    .pointer-events-none { pointer-events: none; }

    #hud {
      top: 14px; left: 20px; right: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: flex-start; pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hud-section { display: flex; gap: 16px; pointer-events: auto; }
    .hud-box {
      background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 8px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; min-width: 95px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), inset 0 0 8px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.1);
    }
    .hud-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; color: #a0a0c0; }
    .hud-value { font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; font-family: var(--font-code); line-height: 1.1; }
    .hud-sub { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 600; color: #ffea00; letter-spacing: 1px; }

    .glow-cyan { color: var(--neon-cyan); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-cyan); }
    .glow-magenta { color: var(--neon-pink); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-pink); }
    .glow-lime { color: var(--neon-lime); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-lime); }
    .glow-yellow { color: var(--neon-yellow); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-yellow); }
    .glow-orange { color: var(--neon-orange); text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-orange); }

    .hud-center { flex: 1; max-width: 380px; margin: 0 20px; }
    .groove-wrapper {
      background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--bg-surface-border); backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.25);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
    }
    .groove-header { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; }
    .groove-title {
      font-size: 12px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-pink));
      -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
    }
    .badge {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-purple));
      color: #fff; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-pink);
    }
    .groove-bar-outer {
      position: relative; width: 100%; height: 12px; background: rgba(10, 8, 25, 0.8);
      border-radius: 6px; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2); overflow: hidden;
    }
    .groove-bar-fill {
      width: 0%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--neon-cyan), var(--neon-lime), var(--neon-yellow), var(--neon-pink));
      background-size: 200% 100%; border-radius: 6px; transition: width 0.15s ease-out;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-pink);
    }
    .fever-banner {
      text-align: center; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: var(--neon-yellow); text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--neon-yellow);
    }

    .target-focus-hud {
      position: absolute; top: 90px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
      background: rgba(15, 12, 35, 0.9); border: 1px solid var(--neon-cyan);
      box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.35); border-radius: 8px; padding: 8px 24px;
      z-index: 25; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    }
    .target-label { font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: 2px; color: #7a7a9e; font-weight: 700; }
    .target-word-display { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 26px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; }
    .target-word-display .typed-part { color: var(--neon-lime); text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--neon-lime); }
    .target-word-display .current-char {
      color: #ffffff; background: var(--neon-pink); border-radius: 4px; padding: 0 4px; box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--neon-pink);
    }
    .target-word-display .remaining-part { color: #8888aa; }

    .announcement-layer {
      position: absolute; top: 38%; left: 50%; transform: translate(-50%, -50%); z-index: 28; text-align: center;
    }
    .big-banner {
      font-size: 46px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 4px; color: #fff;
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--neon-pink), 0 0 60px var(--neon-cyan);
    }
    .sub-banner {
      font-size: 22px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--neon-yellow); text-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-yellow);
      letter-spacing: 3px; margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .keyboard-guide {
      bottom: 12px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%); background: rgba(12, 10, 28, 0.92);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 12px; padding: 10px 16px;
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px); box-shadow: 0 -5px 25px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; max-width: 780px; width: 95vw;
    }
    .kb-toolbar { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; font-size: 11px; }
    .kb-hint { color: #8c8cad; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .zone-tag { font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; color: #000; }
    .zone-tag.pinky { background: var(--finger-pinky); color: #fff; }
    .zone-tag.ring { background: var(--finger-ring); }
    .zone-tag.middle { background: var(--finger-middle); }
    .zone-tag.index { background: var(--finger-index); }
    .zone-tag.thumb { background: var(--finger-thumb); color: #fff; }

    .mini-btn {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: #bbb; font-size: 10px; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer;
    }
    .keyboard-matrix { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }
    .kb-row { display: flex; gap: 4px; width: 100%; justify-content: center; }
    .kb-key {
      font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; width: 38px; height: 34px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: rgba(26, 22, 54, 0.8);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15); border-radius: 6px; color: #d0d0e8; position: relative;
    }
    .kb-key::after {
      content: ''; position: absolute; bottom: 2px; left: 6px; right: 6px; height: 3px;
      border-radius: 2px; background: var(--key-color, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2));
    }
    .kb-key.zone-pinky { --key-color: var(--finger-pinky); border-color: rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.4); }
    .kb-key.zone-ring { --key-color: var(--finger-ring); border-color: rgba(255, 119, 0, 0.4); }
    .kb-key.zone-middle { --key-color: var(--finger-middle); border-color: rgba(57, 255, 20, 0.4); }
    .kb-key.zone-index { --key-color: var(--finger-index); border-color: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4); }
    .kb-key.zone-thumb { --key-color: var(--finger-thumb); border-color: rgba(189, 0, 255, 0.4); }
    .kb-key.space-key { width: 240px; }
    .kb-key.target-candidate { border-color: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.6) !important; box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.4); }
    .kb-key.target-next {
      background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.25) !important; border-color: var(--neon-cyan) !important; color: #ffffff;
      box-shadow: 0 0 15px var(--neon-cyan); transform: translateY(-2px);
    }
    .kb-key.pressed {
      background: var(--key-color, var(--neon-pink)) !important; color: #000 !important; font-weight: 800; transform: translateY(2px) scale(0.96);
    }

    .screen-overlay {
      position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; z-index: 50;
      background: rgba(5, 4, 15, 0.88); backdrop-filter: blur(14px); display: flex;
      align-items: center; justify-content: center; padding: 20px;
    }
    .title-content { text-align: center; max-width: 680px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 16px; }
    .glitch-title {
      font-size: 60px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 6px; color: #ffffff;
      text-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--neon-pink), -3px -3px 0 var(--neon-cyan);
    }
    .subtitle { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 4px; }
    .tagline { font-size: 14px; color: #a0a0c8; max-width: 500px; line-height: 1.5; }
    .features-pill-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; margin: 6px 0; }
    .feature-tag {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px; color: #cfd0f5;
    }
    .menu-actions { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; width: 100%; max-width: 400px; }
    .sub-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; }

    .btn {
      font-family: var(--font-main); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 1.5px; padding: 12px 24px;
      border-radius: 8px; border: none; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 8px;
    }
    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neon-pink), var(--neon-purple));
      color: #fff; font-size: 16px; box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.5);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
    }
    .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-2px) scale(1.02); box-shadow: 0 0 35px var(--neon-pink); }
    .btn-secondary {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      color: #e0e0ff; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 16px;
    }
    .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.16); color: #fff; border-color: var(--neon-cyan); }

    .theme-picker-row { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; margin-top: 10px; }
    .theme-label { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; color: #8888aa; letter-spacing: 1.5px; }
    .theme-dot { width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 50%; border: 2px solid transparent; cursor: pointer; }
    .theme-dot[data-theme="synthwave"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff007f, #00f3ff); }
    .theme-dot[data-theme="acid-arcade"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #39ff14, #ffff00); }
    .theme-dot[data-theme="hyper-pop"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff00c8, #00ffff); }
    .theme-dot[data-theme="cyber-orange"] { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ff7700, #ffe600); }
    .theme-dot.active { border-color: #fff; transform: scale(1.2); }

    .modal-box {
      background: var(--bg-surface); border: 1px solid var(--bg-surface-border);
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8), 0 0 30px rgba(255, 0, 127, 0.25);
      border-radius: 16px; padding: 30px; max-width: 600px; width: 90%;
      display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; max-height: 90vh; overflow-y: auto;
    }
    .modal-box.wide { max-width: 760px; }
    .modal-title { font-size: 24px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 2px; text-align: center; }
    .instruction-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .instr-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 10px; padding: 14px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 6px;
    }
    .instr-icon { font-size: 24px; }
    .instr-card h3 { font-size: 14px; color: var(--neon-cyan); }
    .instr-card p { font-size: 12px; color: #b0b0d0; line-height: 1.4; }

    .level-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; }
    .level-card {
      background: rgba(20, 15, 45, 0.8); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; cursor: pointer; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px;
    }
    .level-card:hover { border-color: var(--neon-cyan); transform: translateY(-3px); }
    .level-num-badge { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--neon-pink); }
    .level-badge-tag { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.15); color: var(--neon-cyan); }

    .rank-stamp {
      position: absolute; top: 15px; right: 25px; font-family: var(--font-arcade); font-size: 48px;
      color: var(--neon-yellow); text-shadow: 0 0 25px var(--neon-yellow); transform: rotate(12deg);
      border: 3px dashed var(--neon-yellow); width: 70px; height: 70px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; border-radius: 12px;
    }
    .stats-matrix { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 12px; margin: 10px 0; }
    .stat-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px;
    }
    .stat-label { font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; color: #8888aa; letter-spacing: 1px; }
    .stat-num { font-family: var(--font-code); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 800; }
    .summary-tip {
      font-size: 12px; color: #d0d0f5; background: rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 243, 255, 0.2);
      border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 14px; text-align: left;
    }
    .summary-buttons { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; margin-top: 10px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div id="game-container">
    <canvas id="game-canvas"></canvas>
    <div class="crt-overlay"></div>
    <div class="vignette"></div>

    <!-- HUD -->
    <header id="hud" class="hud-layer hidden">
      <div class="hud-section hud-left">
        <div class="hud-box">
          <span class="hud-label">SCORE</span>
          <span id="score-display" class="hud-value glow-cyan">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hud-box">
          <span class="hud-label">LEVEL</span>
          <span id="level-display" class="hud-value glow-yellow">1</span>
          <span id="level-name" class="hud-sub">NEON ALLEY</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-section hud-center">
        <div class="groove-wrapper">
          <div class="groove-header">
            <span class="groove-title">GROOVE OVERDRIVE</span>
            <span id="multiplier-badge" class="badge">1.0x</span>
          </div>
          <div class="groove-bar-outer">
            <div id="groove-bar-fill" class="groove-bar-fill"></div>
          </div>
          <div id="fever-text" class="fever-banner hidden">★ FEVER OVERDRIVE ACTIVE ★</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hud-section hud-right">
        <div class="hud-box">
          <span class="hud-label">WPM</span>
          <span id="wpm-display" class="hud-value glow-magenta">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hud-box">
          <span class="hud-label">ACCURACY</span>
          <span id="acc-display" class="hud-value glow-lime">100%</span>
        </div>
        <div class="hud-box">
          <span class="hud-label">COMBO</span>
          <span id="combo-display" class="hud-value glow-orange">0</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- Center Floating announcement -->
    <div id="announcement-layer" class="announcement-layer pointer-events-none">
      <div id="big-banner" class="big-banner hidden">LEVEL COMPLETE</div>
      <div id="sub-banner" class="sub-banner hidden">GROOVY!</div>
    </div>

    <!-- Target Focus HUD -->
    <div id="target-focus-hud" class="target-focus-hud hidden">
      <span class="target-label">LOCK-ON TARGET</span>
      <div id="target-word-display" class="target-word-display">
        <span class="typed-part"></span><span class="current-char"></span><span class="remaining-part"></span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Keyboard Guide -->
    <footer id="keyboard-guide" class="keyboard-guide hud-layer hidden">
      <div class="kb-toolbar">
        <span class="kb-hint">FINGER GUIDE: 
          <span class="zone-tag pinky">PINKY</span>
          <span class="zone-tag ring">RING</span>
          <span class="zone-tag middle">MIDDLE</span>
          <span class="zone-tag index">INDEX</span>
          <span class="zone-tag thumb">THUMB</span>
        </span>
        <button id="toggle-kb-btn" class="mini-btn">HIDE KEYBOARD [TAB]</button>
      </div>
      <div class="keyboard-matrix" id="kb-matrix"></div>
    </footer>

    <!-- TITLE SCREEN -->
    <div id="screen-title" class="screen-overlay">
      <div class="title-content">
        <div class="glitch-title">CHROMA-TYPE</div>
        <div class="subtitle glow-magenta">GROOVE OVERDRIVE // 节奏打字机</div>
        <p class="tagline">The Rhythm-Infused Chromatic Touch-Typing Odyssey</p>
        <div class="features-pill-row">
          <span class="feature-tag">✦ 360° Neon Matrix</span>
          <span class="feature-tag">✦ Multi-Tier Combos</span>
          <span class="feature-tag">✦ Wildcard Jackpots</span>
          <span class="feature-tag">✦ Synth Beat Synthesis</span>
          <span class="feature-tag">✦ Boss Clashes</span>
        </div>
        <div class="menu-actions">
          <button id="btn-start" class="btn btn-primary">▶ START ADVENTURE [SPACE / ENTER]</button>
          <div class="sub-actions">
            <button id="btn-level-select" class="btn btn-secondary">LEVEL SELECT</button>
            <button id="btn-how-to-play" class="btn btn-secondary">HOW TO PLAY</button>
            <button id="btn-sound-toggle" class="btn btn-secondary">🔊 SOUND: ON</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="theme-picker-row">
          <span class="theme-label">PALETTE:</span>
          <button class="theme-dot active" data-theme="synthwave" title="Cyber Synthwave"></button>
          <button class="theme-dot" data-theme="acid-arcade" title="Acid Arcade Lime"></button>
          <button class="theme-dot" data-theme="hyper-pop" title="Hyper-Pop Pink"></button>
          <button class="theme-dot" data-theme="cyber-orange" title="Solar Matrix"></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- HOW TO PLAY MODAL -->
    <div id="screen-instructions" class="screen-overlay hidden">
      <div class="modal-box">
        <h2 class="modal-title glow-cyan">HOW TO PLAY // CHROMATIC PROTOCOL</h2>
        <div class="instruction-grid">
          <div class="instr-card">
            <div class="instr-icon">🎯</div>
            <h3>1. Target & Lock On</h3>
            <p>Word orbs spiral toward the center. Press the <strong>first letter</strong> of any incoming word to <strong>Lock On</strong> laser sights.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="instr-card">
            <div class="instr-icon">⚡</div>
            <h3>2. Color Shockwaves</h3>
            <p>Finish typing the word to trigger a shockwave. Neighboring orbs of the same neon color explode in chain reactions!</p>
          </div>
          <div class="instr-card">
            <div class="instr-icon">🔥</div>
            <h3>3. Groove Overdrive</h3>
